{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyMFdpbmQlMjAlMjgyMDE4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Wind","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kcfPHZHSQODLCWdkUVLYATNyEVo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cy70DnmcGf1Vo9XKYrz2t8NUzMS.jpg","description":"Lizzy is a tough, resourceful frontierswoman settling a remote stretch of land on the 19th-century American frontier. Isolated from civilization in a desolate wilderness where the wind never stops howling, she begins to sense a sinister presence that seems to be borne of the land itself, and when a newlywed couple arrive at a nearby homestead, their presence amplifies Lizzy's fears, setting into motion a shocking chain of events.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Horror","Mystery","Western","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"88 min","cast":["Caitlin Gerard","Ashley Zukerman","Julia Goldani Telles","Miles Anderson","Dylan McTee","Martin Patterson"],"director":["Emma Tammi"],"released":"2018-05-05T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"It never stops.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Caitlin Gerard","character":"Lizzy Macklin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z0iCiV5kUb3GtKSlJ5BFZMCuRy9.jpg"},{"name":"Ashley Zukerman","character":"Isaac Macklin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tKT5ybCjMOV4whEQ6jy8ZQnrP7C.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Goldani Telles","character":"Emma Harper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m5R44HlzFp03BvPGIBlwEbEZqSB.jpg"},{"name":"Miles Anderson","character":"The Reverend","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i4VFdmtrRrQoagTlHHlC1klwJAE.jpg"},{"name":"Dylan McTee","character":"Gideon Harper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wVPAawiEjIB1oS8MONDm5Bqwc9r.jpg"},{"name":"Martin Patterson","character":"Eli","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l7K5OrIAZFLgs6Ibepib4VowIkO.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"HnlH9bEh5lY","type":"Trailer"},{"source":"WVZBNT0Ap-A","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","yt